{"obsah":"<p>This year's first camp for men was very much about May drizzle. The forecast was completely off – when it was supposed to be sunny it rained, and vice versa. Anyway, it wasn't a downpour, and a classic windbreaker kept everyone alive and at a reasonable operating temperature. </p>\n\n<p>As it was an intermediate camp, it was clear we'd tackle harder things. After the morning classics in the Tehov park we went straight to the descents in the former quarry, where a few tricky muddy, rocky lines run. In the end everyone found their limit, and more than one die-hard who couldn't resist temptation ended up on their side on the slope. Fortunately there were no serious injuries or trips to hospital, and in the end everyone outdid themselves and hopefully took away something useful from the camp for the trails and the future..</p>\n\n<p>Now just repeat, train and try :) Hopefully see you again at a men's camp during/after the summer holidays.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2F189405258_2228043573992378_4421202224524241251_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2F189405258_2228043573992378_4421202224524241251_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"191982\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2F189405258_2228043573992378_4421202224524241251_n.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=191982\" class=\"wp-image-191982\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2F189916557_2228043